	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Lifecycle - Application - Okta Application Deactivated",
	"Description": "An Okta application was deactivated, which cuts every assigned user off from it. Deactivation is a cheap way to disrupt a business process, and it is also used to hide a malicious app after the adversary is done with it.\n\nEvent type: application.lifecycle.deactivate\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/impact_okta_attempt_to_deactivate_okta_application/",
